# Environment & Secrets
# Every .env variant, INCLUDING the timestamped backups tooling leaves behind.
# `.env` alone did not match `.env.bak-1787906394`, which held the live R2 secret,
# the JWT signing keys and the at-rest encryption key — one `git add -A` from
# being published.
.env
.env.bak*
.env.before*
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.staging
.env.test
!.env.example

